<% content_for :title, "About Sabha — Open Source Community Chat Built on Campfire" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Sabha is community chat that's familiar, small, and yours. Open source, free to use, free to leave. Built by Ashwin M. on Campfire by 37signals." %>

<div class="landing">

<%= render "shared/marketing_header" %>

<%# ═══════════════════════════════════ ABOUT ═══════════════════════════════════ %>
<section class="landing-section" style="padding-top: 6rem;">
  <div class="landing-inner" style="max-width: 680px;">
    <div class="landing-section-header">
      <span class="landing-label">ABOUT</span>
      <h1 class="landing-section-title">Sabhā (सभा)</h1>
    </div>

    <div style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-text-secondary, #555);">
      <p><i>A Sanskrit word meaning an assembly, a gathering, a place where people come together.</i></p>

      <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Communities deserve chat they can call their own — open source, self-hostable, free of subscriptions and feature bloat. Sabha keeps what Discord and Slack got right (rooms, threads, search) and strips the rest.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Built by <a href="https://x.com/ashwinm" target="_blank" class="landing-link">Ashwin M.</a> — solopreneur and rubyist. Sabha is an attempt to build an open-source business the bootstrapped way — no VC money, no enterprise sales.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text-primary, #111);">Get in touch</h3>

      <ul style="margin-top: 1rem; list-style: none; padding: 0;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><a href="https://github.com/sabha-co/sabha" target="_blank" class="landing-link">GitHub</a></li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><a href="https://x.com/ashwinm" target="_blank" class="landing-link">X (Twitter)</a></li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">ashwin[at]sabha.co</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="landing-divider"></div>

<%= render "shared/marketing_footer" %>

</div>
